  "published": "2026-07-06T16:53:38.463Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "New `scratch` command: a complete from-scratch Stable Diffusion 1.5 implementation in F#/TorchSharp (CLIP BPE tokenizer + text encoder, VAE, UNet, DDIM/DDPM samplers, CFG, txt2img/img2img, progressive previews). Loads SD v1.x safetensors or stable-diffusion.cpp GGUF (Q4_0/Q8_0) directly; exports both formats back (fine-tune here via diffusionTrainingLoss, serve via txt2img). Exposed as the fuuga_image_scratch MCP tool. Fix: txt2img no longer fails with ThreadCount=0 under StableDiffusion.NET 7.",
